     1718       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
     1719            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
     1720            TITLE ""
     1721            DEFAULT-BUTTON B-exit CANCEL-BUTTON b-quit.
     1722   ASSIGN
     1723          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
     1724          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
     1725   ASSIGN
     1726          BR-rcp:HIDDEN  IN FRAME Dialog-Frame                = TRUE.
     1727   ASSIGN
     1728          EDITOR-1:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
     1729   ASSIGN
     1730          f-dis-tot-obj-name:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
     1731   ASSIGN
     1732          f-issue-name:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
     1733   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
